## Why This Is Asked

This question probes end-to-end KCA trust management for edge satellite networks—new angle focusing on cross-region revocation and hardware roots.

## Key Concepts

- Hardware-backed attestation, regional bootstrap
- short-lived TLS certs with SPIFFE IDs
- PQC crypto agility
- cross-region revocation propagation
- auditing and tamper-evident logs
- test plan for burst loads and link outages

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo flow for certificate rotation
async function rotateCert(node) {
  if (node.cert.expired) {
    const csr = await node.createCSR({ region: node.region, id: node.id });
    const cert = await kca.enrollCSR(csr, { scope: 'satellite-edge' });
    await node.installCert(cert);
  }
}
```

